**Novelty (High):** The paper identifies a genuinely underexplored problem (post-treatment selection in interventional causal discovery) and provides a novel theoretical framework (FI-Markov equivalence, F-PAG) that goes beyond existing equivalence classes. The key insight about structural symmetries differing between selection and causation is genuinely new.

