The paper makes important contributions to understanding LRM evaluation integrity, with comprehensive experiments and novel theoretical insights, but the combination of overclaiming, theoretical limitations, and lack of proposed solutions places it solidly in the upper-mid range rather than the accept-tier papers at 6.5+.

