### DeepCritic Overview
DeepCritic proposes a two-stage framework (SFT with meta-critiquing + RL via GRPO) to train LLM critics for mathematical reasoning. The key innovation is iterative critique data curation where initial critiques are refined through meta-critiquing. The 7B model achieves 69.1 avg F1, surpassing GPT-4o (58.2) and demonstrating practical utility in both error identification and solution refinement.

