- **Compared to Real-time Reasoning (6.5):** Real-time has statistical significance tests and wall-clock validation, but also has model confound. Current paper has broader scope but lacks statistical rigor.
- **Compared to Energy-efficient RVG (7.0):** RVG has rigorous energy measurement methodology with careful controls. Current paper is less rigorous methodologically.
