AUTO-RT introduces a reinforcement learning framework for automatic jailbreak strategy exploration in LLM red-teaming. The paper proposes hierarchical strategy-level optimization (separating strategy generation from query rephrasing) and Progressive Reward Tracking with a novel First Inverse Rate (FIR) metric to address sparse rewards using downgrade models. Evaluation covers 16 white-box LLMs and several black-box models.

