## Comparative Analysis

The paper under review presents a comprehensive empirical analysis of verifiers in reinforcement learning for mathematical reasoning, identifying limitations in both rule-based and model-based approaches and proposing a hybrid solution.

**Positioning Against Calibration Examples:**

