- Similar to ChemTable and MESA & MASK (both 4.5) in pattern—valuable contribution with methodological gaps
- Slightly stronger than these 4.5 papers due to extensive multi-perspective validation and practical resource value
- Weaker than Mirror Flow (5.3) which has rigorous theory despite practical limitations
- Much weaker than strong accepts (Dens3R 6.0, HUBBLE 7.5, VIST3A 8.0)

The paper's novelty (moderate), technical soundness (partial—strong experimental design but flawed theoretical grounding), empirical support (good), significance (moderate-to-high), and clarity (adequate) collectively place it in the 5.0 range—a borderline contribution that offers value despite notable flaws.

