## Analysis

The paper under review proposes **On-Demand Communication (ODC)** for FSDP training, reframing FSDP as a decentralized parameter server by replacing per-layer collective communication with point-to-point RDMA primitives. This decouples device execution and enables better load balancing under imbalanced workloads.

### Calibration Reviews Read

