The paper has **weaker theoretical validation** than Beyond Spectra (5.6) or Mirror FM (5.3):
- No empirical verification of central assumption (e.g., testing if generated samples at interpolated conditions match linear combinations)
- Metric misalignment (theory defines conditional diversity, evaluation uses unconditional metric)
